t Broker"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 207 186 9952"]},{"type":"p","children":["Damon Heath / Isabella Pierre"]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["THIS ANNOUNCEMENT CONTAINS INSIDE INFORMATION AS STIPULATED UNDER THE UK VERSION OF THE MARKET ABUSE REGULATION NO. 596/2014 WHICH IS PART OF ENGLISH LAW BY VIRTUE OF THE EUROPEAN UNION (WITHDRAWAL) ACT 2018, AS AMENDED.  UPON PUBLICATION OF THIS ANNOUNCEMENT VIA A REGULATORY INFORMATION SERVICE, THIS INFORMATION IS CONSIDERED TO BE IN THE PUBLIC DOMAIN."]},{"type":"p","children":["About Kendrick Resources Plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Kendrick Resources Plc is a mineral exploration and development company whose strategy is to acquire and enhance the value of its mineral resource projects through exploration, technical studies and resource development and to bring projects to production through joint venture or other arrangements or their sale."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Kendrick Board has extensive resource project experience in southern Africa and has gravitated back to the region with the acquisition of the Bonya Rare Earth Project located in Namibia and in late 2025 exercised an option in relation to the acquisition of the Blue Fox Licence, 34412-HQ-LEL located in northwest Zambia."]},{"type":"p","children":["About Teufelskuppe:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Development Plan Progress"]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company is progressing the TK project in line with the published Development Plan schedule announced on 6 May 2026. Verification of the in-house MRE and upgrading to compliance with JORC (2012) has been initiated alongside the still progressing diamond drilling and reverse circulation drilling campaign to ascertain the depth and sub-surface spread of carbonatite mineralisation below the natural surface profile of the TK landscape."]},{"type":"p","children":["Glossary:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Carbonatite: An igneous rock containing \u003e50 modal % primary (magmatic) carbonate and ≤20 wt% SiO2. There are three main types: Calcitic (calcio) carbonatites, magnesiocarbonatites and ferrocarbonatites. Occur as lava flows and more commonly as intrusions."]},{"type":"p","children":["Carbonate: Common minerals containing the carbonate anion (CO32-) for example calcite (CaCO3), dolomite (CaMg(CO3)2, siderite (FeCO3) and Ankerite Ca(Fe,Mg,Mn)(CO3)2."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cone sheet: A type of ring intrusion with margins which dip inwards"]},{"type":"p","children":["Ferrocarbonatite: A carbonatite in which the main carbonate mineral is iron-rich, for example, ferroan dolomite, ankerite or siderite."]},{"type":"p","children":["Fluorcarbonates: A group of minerals consisting of variable calcium, high fluorine, and rare earth elements. Examples are Synchysite and Parisite."]},{"type":"p","children":["MRE: Mineral Resource Estimate"]},{"type":"p","children":["Parisite: A group of fluorcarbonates with typical mineral formula Ca(Ce/La/Nd/REE)2(CO3)3F2."]},{"type":"p","children":["pXRF: X-ray fluorescence"]},{"type":"p","children":["JORC 2012 Mineral Resource Code: The Australian Code for Reporting Exploration results, Mineral resources and Ore reserves. Enforces minimum standards and guidelines for public reporting of mineral resources and ore reserves. Classifies mineral resources into Inferred, Indicated and Measured based on the level of geological confidence regarding the quality and quantity of the resource."]},{"type":"p","children":["Petrological studies: the study of the formation of rocks, subsequent deformation and alteration. Quantification of mineral composition and mineral relationships."]},{"type":"p","children":["REE: Rare Earth Elements. Elements with an atomic number between 57 and 71 plus Scandium and Yttrium."]},{"type":"p","children":["TREE: Total Rare Earth Elements; sum of LREE and HREE to a total of 17 elements."]},{"type":"p","children":["LREE: Light Rare Earth Elements including Lanthanum (La), Cerium (Ce), Neodymium (Nd), Praseodymium (Pr), Scandium (Sc), Samarium (Sm) and Europium (Eu) and Promethium (Pm)."]},{"type":"p","children":["HREE: Heavy Rare Earth Elements including Yttrium (Y), Gadolinium (Gd), Terbium (Tb), Dysprosium (Dy), Holmium (Ho), Erbium (Er), Thulium (Tm), Ytterbium (Yb) and Lutetium (Lu)."]},{"type":"p","children":["LREO: Light Rare Earth Oxides including La2O3, CeO2, Nd2O3, Pr6O11, Sc2O3, Sm2O3, Eu2O3."]},{"type":"p","children":["HREO: Heavy Rare Earth Oxides including Y2O3, Gd2O3, Tb4O7, Dy2O3, Ho2O3, Er2O3, Tm2O3, Yb2O3 and Lu2O3."]},{"type":"p","children":["TREO: Total Rare Earth Oxides."]},{"type":"p","children":["Wt % = Weight Percentage"]},"This information is provided by RNS, the news service of the London Stock Exchange. RNS is approved by the Financial Conduct Authority to act as a Primary Information Provider in the United Kingdom. Terms and conditions relating to the use and distribution of this information may apply. For further information, please contact rns@lseg.com or visit www.rns.com.",{"type":"p","children":["RNS may use your IP address to confirm compliance with the terms and conditions, to analyse how you engage with the information contained in this communication, and to share such analysis on an anonymised basis with others as part of our commercial services. For further information about how RNS and the London Stock Exchange use the personal data you provide us, please see our Privacy Policy.   END  DRLPPUBABUPQGCR"]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"London Stock Exchange","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"lse"}]},{"title":"Strategy, business, and products","args":[{"id":"section","value":"strategy_business_products"}]},{"title":"UK stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"GB"}]}],"copyright":"Copyright 2019 Regulatory News Service, all rights reserved","id":"tag:reuters.com,2026-09-29:newsml_RSc6352Wa:0","title":"REG - Kendrick Resources - Teufelskuppe Delivers Compelling New Drill Results","published":1790661604,"urgency":2,"permission":"preview","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"LSE:KEN","logoid":"kendrick-resources-plc-ord-gbp00003","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"kendrick-resources-plc-ord-gbp00003"}}],"storyPath":"/news/reuters.com,2026-09-29:newsml_RSc6352Wa:0-reg-kendrick-resources-teufelskuppe-delivers-compelling-new-drill-results/","read_time":433,"provider":{"id":"lse","name":"London Stock Exchange","logo_id":"rdp-lse"},"distributor":{"id":"refinitiv","name":"Refinitiv","logo_id":"refinitiv"}}